This release contains evaluation metadata and analysis scripts for Forall-Lean-Agent.
It identifies PutnamBench and its dependency revisions for reproducibility.

PutnamBench is developed by George Tsoukalas, Jasper Lee, John Jennings,
Jimmy Xin, Michelle Ding, Michael Jennings, Amitayush Thakur, and
Swarat Chaudhuri. Its Lean formalizations are distributed under Apache 2.0.
The benchmark itself is available from https://github.com/trishullab/PutnamBench.
